  summary   = {Indoor occupant information has an obvious influence on operating parameters of heating ventilation and air conditioning (HVAC) system, which further affects occupants’ thermal comfort and energy cons... Keywords: HVAC, Ventilation (architecture), Thermal comfort.}
}

